    "body": "Coordinator: step 4 ran. The `site_only` dispatch run 45004413935 on `site/v0.25.0` (e41d7129f) is green: `site` and `pages` succeeded, and https://neotech.github.io/Camcraft/ shows \"CamCraft 0.25.0\".\n\nThis issue stays open. The run skipped the `wasm` job, so `/app/` shows \"The browser build of CamCraft is not part of this copy of the site\". The 0.25.0 browser build exists as the artifact `wasm-app` of the tag run 44976953856. Next: a workflow PR adds an optional dispatch input `app_run_id`, so that a `site_only` run takes the `wasm-app` artifact of that run. Then one more dispatch on `site/v0.25.0`. This issue closes when `/app/` loads the 0.25.0 app.\n",
