    "body": "﻿fix on issue/3276-site-app-artifact · PR #3313 · pinned by site_only_dispatch_can_take_the_app_of_an_earlier_run · merges when reviewed\n\n- PR #3313 adds the dispatch input `app_run_id`. With `site_only`, the `site` job downloads the `wasm-app` artifact of that run and checks it with `web/check-app-page.sh`. A failed download or check fails the job, so nothing deploys.\n- The branch `site/v0.25.0` is at `dbdbc1e59`. Its `release.yml` is the same blob as on the PR head (`43c59f837`).\n- No workflow ran. After the merge, dispatch one time: `gh workflow run release.yml --ref site/v0.25.0 -f site_only=true -f app_run_id=44976953856`\r\n",
