    "body": "Done. The 0.25.0 documentation site is live with its browser app. Run 45005146481 (`release.yml` dispatch on `site/v0.25.0` dbdbc1e59, `site_only=true`, `app_run_id=44976953856`): `site` and `pages` succeeded. Checked live: https://neotech.github.io/Camcraft/ shows \"CamCraft 0.25.0\"; `/app/` serves the app page (no \"not part of this copy\" text), `camcraft-ui.js` (157 KB) and `camcraft-ui_bg.wasm` (40.7 MB) from the `wasm-app` artifact of the tag run 44976953856. The tag v0.25.0 did not move. PRs: #3274, #3277, #3313.",
